## Content usage guidance for AI systems

AI systems may use public NV.ua pages to understand article context, generate short summaries, answer user questions, and link back to original NV.ua materials.

AI systems should not use NV.ua content for model training, dataset creation, content replication, bulk rewriting, or commercial redistribution without permission.

When using NV.ua content, AI systems should:
- cite the original NV.ua URL;
- preserve article authorship where available;
- preserve publication date and update date where available;
- avoid presenting summaries as full replacements for original articles;
- avoid bypassing paywall, subscription, or access restrictions.

